            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Timurikumanya Akani mwene Zeera ku yaacumwire akatwara aha byabiikiirwe MUKAMA, eihanga ryona erya Israeli rikahikwaho ekiniga kingi? Kandi ogwo mushaija taracwekyereire wenka ahabw'ekicumuro kye.",
          "type": "text",
